   "See", " ", "also", " ", 
    "\"\<The U(n) Gelfand\[Dash]Zeitlin system as a tropical limit of \
Ginzburg\[Dash]Weinstein diffeomorphisms\>\""}], " ", "*)"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
